# funnel-gateway (the `web` profile). Copy to gateway.env:
#   cp gateway.env.example gateway.env && chmod 600 gateway.env
# GATEWAY_TOKEN is the machine token the door demands on every request: 32-256 base64url
# characters, never printed by the gateway. Generate one with
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
# The same value is what the BDOBB web preview holds as BACKEND_GATEWAY_TOKEN.
GATEWAY_TOKEN=
# The API's Basic pair, the same values as OPENBB_API_USERNAME/OPENBB_API_PASSWORD in
# credentials.env (which must also set OPENBB_API_AUTH=true: the preflight refuses an open API).
# Repeated here so the gateway never loads credentials.env's provider keys.
OPENBB_API_USERNAME=
OPENBB_API_PASSWORD=
